There are a *lot* of edible monsters in the mines.  Kill
one or two, carry a corpse up while you're still alive,
eat until you're Satiated.  Wander a bit until you are
back to your max hit points, descend again.  Lather
rinse repeat until you've cleared that level of all of
its monsters and explored it.  Then use that level as
your retreat point.  Don't bother with peacefulls unless
you have a reason to do so (some carry good equipment so
kill several hostiles per peacefull and your alignment
stays good).

